{"c":[{"name":"20261015T180306Z-e51cb22495956e9b","text":"Iterate a model on its own branch; land on main only after a test print is verified and photographed, since a release on main now publishes to Cults.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261015T191113Z-ec972aef108162fe","text":"Cults terms v6.1 (2026-03-31, French controls): profile and markdown descriptions may link GitHub. Cults may zero a paid price if the same file is free elsewhere. Selling a free-elsewhere file is abuse. Exclusivity affects featuring only.","type":"note"}]}
